      <tr><td><code>notebooks/</code></td><td>The study notebook: {{ n.task_count }} tasks in {{ tasks | length }} parts</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>results/</code></td><td>Figures (PNG) and tables (CSV) written by the notebook</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>research/</code></td><td>Literature review and research gaps</td></tr>
      <tr><td><code>book/</code></td><td>This book, its template and its build script</td></tr>
